cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use v100-skinny, please cite it as below."
title: "v100-skinny: native mixed NVFP4/FP8 LLM inference on NVIDIA Volta"
abstract: >-
  Executes Qwen3.8-27B's published mixed NVFP4/FP8 weight representation
  unchanged on SM70 (Tesla V100), via hand-written W4A16 (QPN2) and W8A16
  (QPN8) kernels built around Volta's mma.sync.m8n8k4 instruction. No
  FP8-to-FP4 requantization and no persistent FP16 weight copy.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Vertzyas
    given-names: Dennis
version: "1.1"
date-released: "2026-08-19"
license:
